Conclusion

This goal and task model captures the mission’s essential steps, the sequential and fallback (AND/OR) relationships among its sub-goals, and the concrete tasks that a robot (or robots) must execute. Each relationship is justified based on the mission requirements—for example, ensuring that collection precedes delivery and that low battery conditions trigger fallback procedures.

